            "EvilQuince"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "raw_source": "I met Simona, and she revealed to me the true culprit - Peter Quince, the playmaster, is behind us being trapped in Elsinore.",
      "raw_source_sha256": "eb7126ff59eb44b926d577a06202dd3afe07d6049df43d948c0859f63c4763e9",
      "runtime_source": "I met Simona, and she revealed to me the true culprit—Peter Quince, the playmaster, is behind us being trapped in Elsinore.",
